{"id":1171,"level":70,"name":"Подвійний напад (2)","group":"Подвійний напад","format":27,"description":"<p>A double attack is a great trick to attack two pieces at the same time. But you can also use it to attack a piece and a mating square. Your opponent&nbsp;has&nbsp;to protect the mating square (or he&nbsp;loses the game) and cannot save the piece as well.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>What&nbsp;do you have to do?</h3><p>Win&nbsp;material by attacking two things at the same time: two pieces, a piece and the king or a piece and a mating square.</p>","assignment":"","stickerID":44,"examples":[{"fen":"5bk1/2n2p2/7p/n2pP1p1/1p1B4/1P4P1/3NNP1P/6K1 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Ra5,Rc7][%cal Gd4b6]} 1. Bb6 1-0","text":"<p>Чорні коні незахищені. Білий слон вдало використовує це з подвійним нападом! Раптом Чорні потрапляє в біду. Немає способу врятувати обох коней.</p>","format":27}],"puzzles":[{"id":40561,"fen":"2r3k1/5ppp/1n2p3/8/p7/R2N1P2/PK4PP/8 b - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Ya3,Yb2]} 1... Nc4+ 2. Kc3 Nxa3+ 0-1","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":49585,"fen":"r2q1rk1/1bp2ppp/p2p1b2/2pP4/8/1PP2N1P/P4PP1/R1BQR1K1 b - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Ra1,Re1]} 1... Bxc3 {[%csl Ra1,Re1][%cal Gc3a1,Gc3e1]} 0-1","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":41961,"fen":"8/pp2b2k/2p1p2p/4P2r/1P1Pp2P/P7/1B6/5R1K w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Ye7,Yh7]} 1. Rf7+ Kg8 2. Rxe7 1-0","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":40538,"fen":"5bk1/2n2p2/7p/n2pP1p1/1p1B4/1P4P1/3NNP1P/6K1 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Ya5,Yc7]} 1. Bb6 1-0","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":40503,"fen":"2kr3r/pb3pp1/1p1bpn1p/2q1N3/8/3B4/PPPBQPPP/2KRR3 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Yd8,Yh8]} 1. Nxf7 1-0","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":48483,"fen":"6k1/1b4p1/rp1p2qp/4p3/1RPpP3/P7/2Q2P2/2B2K1R b - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Yc2,Yh1]} 1... Bxe4 {[%csl Rc2,Rh1]} 0-1","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":